.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Check expiration:
.IP
.nf
\f[C]
check_cert -H example.com
\f[R]
.fi
.PP
Require hostname match:
.IP
.nf
\f[C]
check_cert -H api.example.com --require-hostname-match
\f[R]
.fi
.PP
